  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="90">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 90</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="90" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeo steleþ, II gelde gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="83" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þeow steleþ, II gelde gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave steals, let him pay 2[-fold] as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave steals, he shall pay twice the value [of the stolen goods], as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">If a slave steals, he is to pay two-fold compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn ein Sklav stiehlt, büsse er [dem Bestohlenen das Entwendete] doppelt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If a slave steals, let him compensate [the one robbed for what was taken] twofold.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
